#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:24
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Pasting Complex Content"
msgstr "Nalepljivanje složenog sadržaja"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When pasting content from other sources, especially documents containing "
"tables, complex formatting or images, be aware that the appearance in Zammad "
"might differ. The editor attempts to preserve your formatting if possible, "
"but inconsistencies can occur. If you face such a situation, try to copy/"
"paste the content one by one or paste plain text and apply the formatting in "
"the editor (see [formatting section](#apply-formatting) below)."
msgstr ""
"Kada nalepite sadržaj iz drugih izvora, posebno dokumente koji sadrže "
"tabele, složeno formatiranje ili slike, imajte na umu da izgled u Zammadu "
"može biti drugačiji. Editor pokušava da sačuva vaše formatiranje ako je "
"moguće, ali mogu se javiti nedoslednosti. Ako se nađete u takvoj situaciji, "
"pokušajte da kopirate/nalepite sadržaj redom ili nalepite običan tekst i "
"primenite formatiranje u editoru (vidi [odeljak za formatiranje](#apply-"
"formatting) ispod)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:31
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Paragraphs"
msgstr "Pasusi"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:36
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To separate paragraphs in the editor, use the [[enter]] key **once**. This "
"gets rendered as paragraphs either with an empty line or without, depending "
"on the recipient's used software. If you add an additional empty line, this "
"can get rendered as two empty lines on client side."
msgstr ""
"Da biste razdvojili pasuse u editoru, koristite taster [[enter]] **jednom**. "
"Ovo se prikazuje kao pasusi ili sa praznom linijom ili bez nje, u zavisnosti "
"od softvera koji prima koristi. Ako dodate još jednu praznu liniju, ovo se "
"može prikazati kao dve prazne linije na strani klijenta."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:37
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Cite Text"
msgstr "Citiranje teksta"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You may want to quote text of your customer to exactly refer your answer to "
"and your customer doesn't lose track in long conversations. To use this "
"feature, simply select the text you want to cite and click on the `reply` or "
"`forward` button next to the article. If you already inserted text, it gets "
"preserved and the selected text gets inserted additionally. This means you "
"can repeat this to cite different sections without losing your written text."
msgstr ""
"Možda ćete hteti da citirate tekst svog klijenta kako biste tačno uputili "
"odgovor i vaš klijent ne bi izgubio tok u dugim razgovorima. Da biste "
"koristili ovu funkciju, jednostavno označite tekst koji želite da citirate i "
"kliknite na dugme `odgovori` ili `prosledi` pored članka. Ako ste već "
"umetnuli tekst, on se zadržava, a izabrani tekst se dodatno ubacuje. To "
"znači da ovo možete ponavljati za citiranje različitih odeljaka bez gubitka "
"vašeg napisanog teksta."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:44
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Apply Formatting"
msgstr "Форматирање текста"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:47
#, fuzzy
msgid "You can format text in the editor in different ways:"
msgstr "Tekst u editoru možete formatirati na različite načine:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:51
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use the integrated toolbar"
msgstr "Koristite integrisanu alatnu traku"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:51
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Пречице на тастатури"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:51
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use [Markdown](https://www.markdownguide.org){target=_blank} syntax"
msgstr "Koristite [Markdown](https://www.markdownguide.org) sintaksu"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:55
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The editor **toolbar** includes buttons for common formatting tasks. "
"Hovering over each button will display a tooltip explaining its function. As "
"an alternative you can use **keyboard shortcuts** (see next two sections). "
"Either activate the formatting in advance or select the text after writing "
"and use the formatting you want to apply."
msgstr ""
"**Alatna traka** editora uključuje dugmad za uobičajene zadatke "
"formatiranja. Prekivanjem miša preko svakog dugmeta prikazaće se alatni opis "
"koji objašnjava njegovu funkciju. Kao alternativu možete koristiti **prečace "
"na tastaturi** (vidi sledeća dva odeljka). Formatiranje možete aktivirati "
"unapred ili označiti tekst nakon pisanja i primeniti formatiranje koje "
"želite."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:56
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "General Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Пречице на тастатури"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The editor also supports keyboard shortcuts to streamline your workflow. "
"These shortcuts are common across many text processing tools. Important "
"shortcuts are:"
msgstr ""
"Editor takođe podržava prečace na tastaturi za optimizaciju vašeg radnog "
"procesa. Ovi prečaci su uobičajeni u mnogim alatima za obradu teksta. Važni "
"prečaci su:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:66
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Shortcut/command              | Formatting\n"
"-------------------------------|---------------\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[b]]               | **Bold**\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[i]]               | _Italics_\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[u]]               | <u>Underline</u>\n"
msgstr ""
" Prečac/naredba              | Formatiranje\n"
"-------------------------------|---------------\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[b]]               | **Podebljano**\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[i]]               | _Kurziv_\n"
"[[ctrl]] + [[u]]               | <u>Zadeno</u>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Have a look at the keyboard shortcuts in Zammad where you can find all "
"shortcuts. Open it via the [avatar menu](/en/documentation/use/user-"
"profile#avatar-menu) in the bottom left corner or type [[?]]."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte prečace na tastaturi u Zammadu gde možete pronaći sve prečace. "
"Otvorite ga putem [avatar menija](/en/documentation/use/user-profile#avatar-"
"menu) u donjem levom uglu ili ukucajte [[?]]."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Have a look at the next section to use even more formatting via keyboard. "
"Regardless if you are used to write Markdown or not, some of them might "
"still be helpful in your daily work."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte sledeći odeljak da biste koristili još više formatiranja putem "
"tastature. Bez obzira na to da li ste navikli na pisanje MarkDown-a ili ne, "
"neki od njih mogu vam biti korisni u svakodnevnom radu."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:73
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Markdown Usage"
msgstr "Korišćenje Markdown-a"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For users familiar with Markdown syntax, the editor provides basic support "
"for formatting content with Markdown. When using Markdown syntax, it gets "
"immediately applied immediately or after the closing limiter so you can see "
"the result directly in the editor. To go back to standard text, simply use "
"the same limiter again or use [[enter]], depending on the option."
msgstr ""
"Korisnicima upućenim u Markdown sintaksu, editor pruža osnovnu podršku za "
"formatiranje sadržaja pomoću MarkDown-a. Kada koristite Markdown sintaksu, "
"ona se odmah primenjuje ili nakon zatvarajuće oznake tako da možete videti "
"rezultat direktno u editoru. Da biste se vratili na standardan tekst, "
"jednostavno ponovo upotrebite istu oznaku ili koristite [[enter]], u "
"zavisnosti od opcije."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is not intended to support all Markdown features, but to help users "
"getting things done more easily. Therefore, the most important things are "
"supported like headings, lists, links, code blocks and more. Have a look at "
"the non-exhaustive formatting examples below."
msgstr ""
"Nije cilj podržati sve funkcije Markdown-a, već pomoći korisnicima da lakše "
"obave svoje zadatke. Zato su podržane najvažnije funkcije poput naslova, "
"lista, linkova, blokova koda i slično. Pogledajte ispod primere formatiranja "
"koji nisu iscrpni."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/editor.md:92
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Markdown Syntax                | Formatting\n"
"-------------------------------|---------------\n"
"`**`                           | Limiter for **bold**\n"
"`_`                            | Limiter for _italics_\n"
"`#`, `##`, `###`               | Heading, level depending on number of `#`\n"
"`>`                            | Quoted\n"
"`` ` ``                        | Limiter for `inline code`\n"
"`` ``` ``                      | Code block\n"
"`---`                          | Horizontal line as divider\n"
msgstr ""
"Markdown sintaksa                | Formatiranje\n"
"-------------------------------|---------------\n"
"`**`                           | Ograničava **bold**\n"
"`_`                            | Ograničava _italics_\n"
"`#`, `##`, `###`               | Naslov, nivo zavisi od broja `#`\n"
"`>`                            | Citat\n"
"`` ` ``                        | Ograničava `inline code`\n"
"`` ``` ``                      | Blok koda\n"
"`---`                          | Horizontalna linija kao razdjelnik\n"

