#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/mobile-view.md:8
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Intro"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/mobile-view.md:14
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The development of a dedicated mobile view for Zammad was driven by the "
"increasing need for access while on the move.  The desktop application "
"offers responsive functionality for smaller screens, but it was determined "
"to be too complex for optimal mobile use. This mobile view focuses on "
"presenting the most critical information in a touch-friendly and modern "
"design, prioritizing a streamlined user experience."
msgstr ""
"Razvoj posebnog mobilnog prikaza za Zammad uslovljen je sve većom potrebom "
"za pristupom dok ste u pokretu. Desktop aplikacija nudi responzivnu "
"funkcionalnost za manje ekrane, ali je utvrđeno da je previše kompleksna za "
"optimalnu upotrebu na mobilnim uređajima. Ovaj mobilni prikaz se fokusira na "
"prezentovanje najkritičnijih informacija u dodiru prijateljskom i modernom "
"dizajnu, stavljajući prioritet na pojednostavljeno korisničko iskustvo."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/mobile-view.md:15
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We intentionally do not provide specific instructions and comprehensive documentation for the mobile view! The overall\n"
"UX should be intuitive and self-explanatory in most cases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Namerno ne pružamo specifična uputstva i opsežnu dokumentaciju za mobilni prikaz! Celokupno\n"
"UX treba da bude intuitivno i samoobjašnjivo u većini slučajeva.\n"

