#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page covers the required steps for a host upgrade and to switch to "
"Zammad's new package repositories. If you just want to update Zammad itself, "
"please refer to [Updating Zammad](update). To just switch to the new "
"repositories without a host upgrade, skip the host upgrade steps."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica pokriva potrebne korake za nadogradnju hosta i prelazak na nove "
"paketne repozitorijume Zammada. Ako želite samo da ažurirate Zammad, "
"pogledajte [Ažuriranje Zammada](update). Da biste se prebacili samo na nove "
"repozitorijume bez nadogradnje hosta, preskočite korake za nadogradnju hosta."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with Zammad 7, packages are being built using a new toolchain and "
"hosted under another URL. The packages are being built via old toolchain as "
"well (except for Debian 13) for some time, but we encourage you to switch to "
"the new repositories in a timely manner. This means you need to add a new "
"repository key and change your repository configuration."
msgstr ""
"Počev od Zammada 7, paketi se grade novom alatnom linijom i hostuju na "
"drugoj URL adresi. Paketi će se graditi i starom alatnom linijom (osim za "
"Debian 13) još neko vreme, ali vas podstičemo da pravovremeno pređete na "
"nove repozitorijume. To znači da morate dodati novi ključ repozitorijuma i "
"promeniti konfiguraciju."

