#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:14
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before updating Zammad, we strongly recommend to take a look at our [release "
"notes](https://zammad.com/en/releases){target=_blank}. You can find "
"information about features and fixes as well as technical remarks and "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"Pre ažuriranja Zammad-a toplo preporučujemo da pogledate naše [beleške o "
"izdanju](https://zammad.com/en/releases){target=_blank}. Ovde možete pronaći "
"informacije o novim funkcijama i ispravkama, kao i tehničke napomene i "
"promene koje zahtevaju prilagodbu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:19
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Be aware that you should not skip major Zammad versions while updating. That "
"means, for example, your upgrade path from version `2.4` to `5.1` (assuming "
"this is the current stable) would be: `2.4` → `3.0` → `4.0` → `5.0` → "
"`latest stable (5.1)`"
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da ne biste trebali preskakati glavne verzije Zammad-a tokom "
"ažuriranja. To znači, na primer, putanja nadogradnje sa verzije `2.4` na "
"`5.1` (pod pretpostavkom da je ovo trenutna stabilna) bi bila: `2.4` → `3.0` "
"→ `4.0` → `5.0` → `najnovija stabilna (5.1)`"

