#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:16
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"If you want to use a `.env` file in Docker Compose deployments, you can use the provided `.env.dist` file and copy it\n"
"to `.env`. That way it will be picked up by Docker Compose automatically and not overwritten during updates.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Уколико желите да користите `.env` датотеку, можете икористити приложену `.env.dist` датотеку и ископирати је у `.env`. На тај начин биће\n"
"аутоматски препозната од стране Docker Compose и преживеће ажурирања.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Razno"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`GPG_PATH` ::p::\n"
": Defines the path of your GPG installation. Only needed if you want to use different versions of PGP or if your PGP\n"
"  installation differs from the standard installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"`GPG_PATH` ::p::\n"
": Definiše putanju vaše GPG instalacije. Potrebno je samo ako želite da koristite različite verzije PGP-a ili ako se vaša PGP\n"
"  instalacija razlikuje od standardne instalacije.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:32
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`RAILS_LOG_TO_STDOUT` ::p::\n"
": This setting can be overwritten during update on package installations. Use `enabled` to turn this option on only\n"
"  until the next update. Use `true` to turn it on permanently.\n"
msgstr ""
"`RAILS_LOG_TO_STDOUT` ::p::\n"
": Ovaj postav se može prepisati tokom ažuriranja kod instalacija paketa. Koristite `enabled` da uključite ovu opciju samo\n"
"  do sledećeg ažuriranja. Koristite `true` da je uključite trajno.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:36
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_SAFE_MODE` ::p::\n"
": Be careful when running Zammad commands on production systems in safe mode. While it may allow an escape hatch for\n"
"  certain commands, it has a potential to break regular Zammad operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_SAFE_MODE` ::p::\n"
": Budite oprezni prilikom pokretanja Zammad komandi na produkcijskim sistemima u sigurnosnom režimu. Iako može omogućiti opciju za zaobilaženje ograničenja za\n"
"  određene komande, postoji mogućnost da ometá redovne Zammad operacije.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_BIND_IP` ::p:: <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"127.0.0.1\" />\n"
": The IP address that the web server is bound to.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_BIND_IP` ::p:: <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"127.0.0.1\" />\n"
": IP adresa na koju je vezan web server.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:43
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`S3_URL` ::p::\n"
": Allows you to provide your S3 storage provider configuration. Example for value:\n"
"  `https://key:secret@s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/zammad-storage-bucket?region=eu-central-1&force_path_style=true`\n"
msgstr ""
"`S3_URL` ::p::\n"
": Omogućava vam da navedete konfiguraciju vašeg S3 provajdera za skladištenje. Primer za vrednost:\n"
"  `https://key:secret@s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/zammad-storage-bucket?region=eu-central-1&force_path_style=true`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`VERSION` ::d:: <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"current stable version of Zammad\" />\n"
": Allows customization of the Zammad image tag. Example: `6.3.1-54`. This default version may be increased when you\n"
"  update your Zammad Docker stack. Please see the\n"
"  [example env file](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/master/.env.dist){target=_blank}\n"
"  for more details on this variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"`VERSION` ::d:: <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"trenutna stabilna verzija Zammada\" />\n"
": Omogućava prilagođavanje oznake slike Zammada. Primer: `6.3.1-54`. Ova podrazumevana verzija se može povećati prilikom\n"
"  ažuriranja vašeg Zammad Docker steka. Pogledajte\n"
"  [primer env fajla](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/master/.env.dist) za više detalja o ovoj\n"
"  promenljivoj.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:57
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`AUTOWIZARD_JSON` ::d::\n"
": This variable allows you to provide initial configuration data for your instance. Autowizard JSON is out of scope of\n"
"  this documentation, however\n"
"  [this example file](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/stable/contrib/auto_wizard_example.json){target=_blank}\n"
"  should help.\n"
msgstr ""
"`AUTOWIZARD_JSON` ::d::\n"
": Ova promenljiva vam omogućava da navedete početne podatke za konfiguraciju vaše instance. JSON Autowizard-a nije u domenu\n"
"  ove dokumentacije, međutim\n"
"  [ovaj primer fajla](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/blob/stable/contrib/auto_wizard_example.json) bi trebalo da vam pomogne.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_HTTP_TYPE` : Set the http type for your instance. Possible values "
"are `http` and `https`."
msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_HTTP_TYPE` : Odredite tip HTTP-a za vašu instancu. Moguće vrednosti "
"su `http` i `https`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:63
#, fuzzy
msgid "`ZAMMAD_FQDN` : Set the FQDN for your instance."
msgstr "`ZAMMAD_FQDN` : Odredite FQDN za vašu instancu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:67
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`RAILS_TRUSTED_PROXIES` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"127.0.0.1,::1\" />\n"
": This setting is important for the correct detection of client IP addresses and features based on it, like rate\n"
"  limiting.\n"
msgstr ""
"`RAILS_TRUSTED_PROXIES` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"127.0.0.1,::1\" />\n"
": Ovaj postav je važan za ispravno otkrivanje IP adresa klijenata i funkcija koje na tome zasnivaju rad, poput ograničavanja\n"
"  brzine.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:71
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  By default, Zammad trusts localhost proxies only. Any additional proxy servers will have to be added here,\n"
"  by IP address (if static) or by host name. Host names are resolved during the start of Zammad, so that a restart is\n"
"  required whenever the IP address of a proxy server changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Podrazumevano, Zammad veruje samo lokalnim proxy serverima. Dodatne proxy servere treba ovde dodati,\n"
"  po IP adresi (ako je statička) ili po host imenu. Host imena se rezoluju prilikom pokretanja Zammada, pa je\n"
"  potrebno ponovno pokretanje kada se IP adresa proxy servera promeni.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:74
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Note that in Docker context, Zammad may see the network   gateway IP address instead of the actual proxy server\n"
"  IP address, if it is placed in another network.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Imajte na umu da u Docker kontekstu Zammad može videti IP adresu mrežnog   gateway-a umesto stvarne IP adrese proxy servera\n"
"  ako se nalazi u drugoj mreži.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:78
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_MANAGE_SESSIONS_JOBS_WORKERS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"0\" />\n"
": Allows to fork the job that dispatches the session jobs to their workers to a child process. Allowed value to enable\n"
"  it: `1`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_MANAGE_SESSIONS_JOBS_WORKERS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"0\" />\n"
": Omogućava odvajanje zadatka koji distribuira sesijske poslove na svoje radnike u podproces. Dozvoljena vrednost za\n"
"  uključivanje: `1`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:84
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"0\" />\n"
": Such a worker handles Zammad’s AI requests and fetches the responses from the configured AI provider. This variable\n"
"  allows you to specify the number of workers to run simultaneously. `0` means a thread in the main process is used, `1`\n"
"  means a separate worker gets spawned, etc. The maximum number of workers is `16`. See also\n"
"  `ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS_THREADS`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"0\" />\n"
": Ovaj radnik obrađuje AI zahteve Zammada i dohvata odgovore od konfigurisanog AI provajdera. Ova promenljiva\n"
"  vam omogućava da navedete broj radnika koji će se pokrenuti istovremeno. `0` znači da se koristi nit u glavnom procesu, `1`\n"
"  znači da se pokreće poseban radnik, itd. Maksimalan broj radnika je `16`. Pogledajte takođe\n"
"  `ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS_THREADS`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:87
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Self hosted AI users should be careful in increasing it, your AI service might collapse. For AI cloud service users\n"
"  with a big Zammad instance, it could make sense to increase it to have some kind of parallelization.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Korisnici samostalno hostovanih AI sistema treba da budu oprezni sa povećavanjem ove vrednosti, vaš AI servis može se srušiti. Za korisnike AI cloud servisa\n"
"  sa velikom Zammad instancom, može biti smisleno povećati broj radnika radi određenog oblika paralelizacije.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:92
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS_THREADS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"5\" />\n"
": How many threads should be processed by a **single** AI worker (if you run more than one worker process, it gets\n"
