msgstr ""
"`ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_AI_JOBS_WORKERS_THREADS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"5\" />\n"
": Koliko niti treba da obradi **jedan** AI radnik (ako pokrećete više procesa radnika, ova vrednost se\n"
"  množi). Ovo može ubrzati obradu AI zahteva, ali imajte na umu da Ruby radnik uvek koristi samo 1 jezgro.\n"
"  Maksimalan broj niti je `16`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/environment-variables.md:97
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ZAMMAD_PROCESS_DELAYED_COMMUNICATION_INBOUND_JOBS_WORKERS` <Badge type=\"tip\" text=\"0\" />\n"
": Allows concurrent fetching of inbound communication channels. Useful if you have many channels and/or mailboxes added.\n"
