msgid ""
"How long does Zammad store user data? How can I manage its user data "
"retention behavior? To which services connects Zammad?"
msgstr ""
"Koliko dugo Zammad čuva korisničke podatke? Kako mogu upravljati ponašanjem "
"zadržavanja korisničkih podataka? Kojim servisima se povezuje Zammad?"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Чување података"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:14
#, fuzzy
msgid "The following data is stored locally on the production system:"
msgstr "Sledeći podaci su čuvani lokalno na produkcijskom sistemu:"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:15
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Tickets and Users"
msgstr "Rails команде"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:18
#, fuzzy
msgid "By default, Zammad never automatically deletes tickets or users."
msgstr "Podrazumevano, Zammad nikada automatski ne briše tikete ili korisnike."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To enable **automatic** deletion of tickets after a given interval,\n"
"use Zammad's scheduler. You can configure it in Zammad's admin interface under\n"
"_Manage > Scheduler_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Da biste omogućili **automatsko** brisanje tiketa nakon određenog intervala,\n"
"koristite Zammad-ov scheduler. Možete ga konfigurisati u adminsinterfejsu Zammad-a pod\n"
"_Upravljaj > Scheduler_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To **manually** delete users and all their associated tickets (e.g. in\n"
"compliance with a \"Right to Forget\" request under the GDPR), you can use\n"
"the data privacy functions in the admin panel under _System > Data Privacy_\n"
"or [use the console](/en/reference/rails-commands#deleting-records).\n"
msgstr ""
"Da biste **ručno** obrisali korisnike i sve njihove povezane tikete (npr. u\n"
"skladu sa zahtevom za 'Pravo na zaborav' prema GDPR), možete koristiti\n"
"funkcije zaštite podataka u adminsinterfejsu pod _Sistem > Zaštita podataka_\n"
"i [koristiti konzolu](/en/reference/rails-commands#deleting-records).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Chat sessions"
msgstr "Rails команде"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once a chat session has been marked **closed**, it is scheduled for "
"automatic deletion 12 months later. IP address logs for chat sessions can be "
"deleted manually by following the [steps from the rails console page](/en/"
"reference/rails-commands#remove-ip-address-logs)."
msgstr ""
"Kada se sesija čata označi kao **zatvorena**, planira se automatsko brisanje "
"nakon 12 meseci. Zapisi IP adresa za sesije čata mogu se obrisati ručno "
"praćenjem [koraka sa stranice rails konzole](/en/reference/rails-"
"commands#remove-ip-address-logs)."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:35
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "CTI caller log"
msgstr "CTI zapis pozivaoca"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The caller log shows only the 60 most recent entries. Each entry in the "
"caller log is automatically deleted after 12 months."
msgstr ""
"Zapis pozivaoca prikazuje samo 60 najnovijih unosa. Svaki unos u zapisu "
"pozivaoca automatski se briše nakon 12 meseci."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:40
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Log files"
msgstr "Fajlovi dnevnika"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:43
#, fuzzy
msgid "Zammad writes log files to disk (typically under `/opt/zammad/log/`)."
msgstr ""
"Zammad piše fajlove dnevnika na disk (tipično ispod `/opt/zammad/log/`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:47
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Package installations will set up a separate system utility called "
"`logrotate` to rename and archive (or _rotate_) log files on a nightly basis "
"and remove old logs after 14 days."
msgstr ""
"Instalacije paketa će postaviti posebni sistemski alat pod nazivom "
"`logrotate` za preimenovanje i arhiviranje (ili _rotaciju_) fajlova dnevnika "
"na noćnoj bazi i uklanjanje starih dnevnika nakon 14 dana."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If installing from source, it is strongly recommended to configure "
"`logrotate` or a similar log management utility; Zammad will not purge old "
"logs on its own."
msgstr ""
"Pri instalaciji iz izvornog koda, snažno se preporučuje konfigurisanje "
"`logrotate` ili sličnog alata za upravljanje dnevnikom; Zammad neće sam "
"uklanjati stare dnevnike."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:52
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "User sessions"
msgstr "Rails команде"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Zammad maintains session information about every user currently logged in."
msgstr ""
"Zammad čuva informacije o sesiji za svakog trenutno prijavljenog korisnika."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:61
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This information is automatically purged when a user logs out, and can\n"
"be viewed or manually deleted via the admin panel (under _System >\n"
"Sessions_). Users may also delete their own session information via the\n"
"user preferences menu, under _Devices_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ove informacije se automatski brišu pri odjavljivanju korisnika i mogu se\n"
"pogledati ili ručno obrisati preko adminsinterfejsa (pod _Sistem >\n"
"Sesije_). Korisnici takođe mogu obrisati sopstvene informacije o sesiji kroz\n"
"meniju postavki korisnika, pod _Uređaji_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Session information includes IP address (and possibly geographic location), "
"browser, time of original login, and time of last visit."
msgstr ""
"Informacije o sesiji uključuju IP adresu (i moguće geografsku lokaciju), "
"pregledač, vreme prvog prijavljivanja i vreme poslednjeg posete."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:65
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Data Privacy Tasks"
msgstr "Zadaci zaštite podataka"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Each entry in the data privacy task list is automatically deleted after 12 "
"months."
msgstr ""
"Svaki unos u listi zadataka zaštite podataka automatski se briše nakon 12 "
"meseci."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Services"
msgstr "Удаљени сервиси"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:76
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Zammad utilizes third party web services for certain functions, meaning\n"
"that user data may occasionally be sent or exposed to third parties.\n"
"These functions can be individually disabled in the admin panel under\n"
"_Settings > System > Services_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zammad koristi usluge trećih strana za određene funkcije, što znači\n"
"da se korisnički podaci povremeno mogu slati ili izlagati trećim stranama.\n"
"Ove funkcije se mogu pojedinačno onemogućiti u adminsinterfejsu pod\n"
"_Postavke > Sistem > Usluge_.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:77
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, the third party services that Zammad relies on are mostly\n"
"ones hosted and managed by the Zammad Foundation itself, but Zammad\n"
"can be extended to interface with other services instead.\n"
"\n"
"The source code for these third party service integrations can be\n"
"found in\n"
"[our repository](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/tree/develop/lib/service){target=_blank}.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podrazumevano, usluge trećih strana na koje se Zammad oslanja su uglavnom\n"
"e one koji su hostovani i upravljani od strane same Zammad Fondacije, ali se Zammad\n"
"može proširiti tako da umesto njih koristi druge servise.\n"
"\n"
"Izvorni kod za ove integracije sa uslugama trećih strana može se\n"
"naći u\n"
"[našem repozitorijumu](https://github.com/zammad/zammad/tree/develop/lib/service){target=_blank}.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:87
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Slike"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:91
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"No private images or personally-identifying information are stored on "
"images.zammad.com."
msgstr ""
"Ne čuvaju se privatne slike ni lično identifikacioni podaci na "
"images.zammad.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:97
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Images service caches publicly-available images from sources like "
"Gravatar and serves them to the Zammad application as user avatars and "
"organization logos. These images are discovered using MD5 digests of user "
"email addresses and organization domain names. User avatars are cached for 7 "
"days; organization logos are cached for 30 days."
msgstr ""
"Usluga Slike kešira javno dostupne slike sa izvora kao što je Gravatar i "
"dostavlja ih Zammad aplikaciji kao korisničke avatarе i logotipe "
"organizacija. Ove slike se otkrivaju korišćenjem MD5 heševa email adresa "
"korisnika i domena organizacija. Korisnički avatar-i se keširaju 7 dana; "
"logotipi organizacija se keširaju 30 dana."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:98
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "GeoCalendar"
msgstr "Календар"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:101 src/en/reference/privacy.md:110
#, fuzzy
msgid "No user information is stored or cached on geo.zammad.com."
msgstr ""
"Na geo.zammad.com ne čuvaju se niti keširaju informacije o korisnicima."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:106
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As part of its service-level agreement (SLA) functionality, Zammad requires "
"detailed, localized calendar information (e.g. to set the time zone and "
"accommodate national holidays and daylight savings time).  The GeoCalendar "
"service is used to retrieve this information."
msgstr ""
"Kao deo funkcionalnosti ugovora o nivou usluga (SLA), Zammad zahteva "
"detaljne, lokalizovane kalendarske informacije (npr. za postavljanje "
"vremenske zone i prilagođavanje državnih praznika i prelaska na letnje "
"računanje vremena). Za prikupljanje ovih informacija koristi se usluga "
"GeoCalendar."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:107
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "GeoIP"
msgstr "GeoIP"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of Zammad's security features is to track user sessions based on the "
"user's browser and country of origin. Suspicious login activity from a "
"different browser or country may trigger Zammad to dispatch an alert email "
"to the affected user. The GeoIP service is used to associate IP addresses to "
"a geographic origin."
msgstr ""
"Jedna od sigurnosnih funkcija Zammad-a je praćenje korisničkih sesija na "
"osnovu pregledača i zemlje porekla korisnika. Sumnjiva aktivnost "
"prijavljivanja sa drugog pregledača ili zemlje može potaći Zammad da pošalje "
"alarmnu poruku emailom dotičnom korisniku. Usluga GeoIP se koristi za "
"povezivanje IP adresa sa geografskim poreklom."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:117
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Geolocation"
msgstr "Администрација"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/privacy.md:124
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Zammad's geolocation service relies on OpenStreetMap (OSM) unless you turned "
"it off. If you provide an address (or parts of an address) in a user object, "
"there is a lookup of coordinates from OSM which are stored in Zammad's "
"database. Have a look at their [privacy policy](https://osmfoundation.org/"
"wiki/Privacy_Policy){target=_blank} for more information."
msgstr ""
"Usluga geolokacije Zammad-a oslanja se na OpenStreetMap (OSM) osim ako je "
"nije isključili. Ako u objektu korisnika navedete adresu (ili delove "
"adrese), vrši se pretraga koordinata iz OSM-a koje se čuvaju u bazi podataka "
"Zammad-a. Za više informacija pogledajte njihovu [politiku privatnosti]"
"(https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy){target=_blank}."

