#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:359
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Call Hangup"
msgstr "Prekid poziva"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:365
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`event` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"hangup\" />:\n"
": Tell Zammad that someone answered the call.\n"
msgstr ""
"`event` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"hangup\" />:\n"
": Obavestite Zammad da je poziv prekinut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:389
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`cause`\n"
":   This defines the reason of the hangup. Zammad evaluates the cause and indicates\n"
"    e.g. missed calls accordingly in the caller log. Possible values are:\n"
"    - `normalClearing` (one of the parties hung up after the call was established)\n"
"    - `busy` (the called party was busy)\n"
"    - `cancel` (the caller hung up before the called party picked up)\n"
"    - `noAnswer` (the called party rejected the call. E.g. through a DND setting)\n"
"    - `congestion` (the called party could not be reached)\n"
"    - `notFound` (the called number does not exist or called party is offline)\n"
"    - `forwarded` (the call was forwarded to a different party)\n"
msgstr ""
"`cause`\n"
":   Ovo definiše razlog prekida poziva. Zammad procenjuje uzrok i prikazuje\n"
"    npr. propuštene pozive u dnevniku pozivaca. Moguće vrednosti su:\n"
"    - `normalClearing` (jedna od strana je prekinula vezu nakon uspostavljanja poziva)\n"
"    - `busy` (birena strana je bila zauzeta)\n"
"    - `cancel` (pozivač je prekinuo vezu pre nego što je birena strana odgovorila)\n"
"    - `noAnswer` (birena strana je odbila poziv, npr. putem DND podešavanja)\n"
"    - `congestion` (birena strana nije mogla biti dostignuta)\n"
"    - `notFound` (bireni broj ne postoji ili birena strana je van mreže)\n"
"    - `forwarded` (poziv je preusmeren na drugu stranu)\n"

