#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:71
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints and Example Data"
msgstr "Krajnje tačke i primeri podataka"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For simplicity we'll not provide specific commands on the next pages, but "
"instead tell the possible call method (e.g. `GET`) and the endpoint to use "
"(e.g. `/api/v1/users`). In case Zammad expects information within these "
"endpoint urls, we'll put them into curly braces like so: `/api/v1/users/"
"{user id}`"
msgstr ""
"Zbog jednostavnosti na narednim stranicama nećemo navoditi specifične "
"komande, već ćemo navesti moguću metodu poziva (npr. `GET`) i krajnju tačku "
"za korišćenje (npr. `/api/v1/users`). U slučaju da Zammad očekuje "
"informacije unutar URL-ova ovih krajnjih tačaka, stavićemo ih u vitičaste "
"zagrade na sledeći način: `/api/v1/users/{user id}`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The response format will be a complete JSON response from a default Zammad "
"instance. Please keep in mind that you may see more fields or general "
"information in case you added objects or other information."
msgstr ""
"Format odgovora biće kompletna JSON poruka od podrazumevanog instancu "
"Zammada. Imajte na umu da možete videti više polja ili opšte informacije "
"ukoliko ste dodali objekte ili druge podatke."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:83
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Content Type"
msgstr "Vrsta sadržaja"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:88
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Zammad returns JSON payloads whenever you retrieve data. If you're going to "
"provide data, no matter of the general request type, don't forget to provide "
"the content type `application/json` as well."
msgstr ""
"Zammad vraća JSON payload-e svaki put kada preuzimate podatke. Ako ćete "
"prosleđivati podatke, bez obzira na vrstu zahteva, ne zaboravite da navedete "
"i tip sadržaja `application/json`."

