#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:136
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr "Превод"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As Zammad limits the number of returned objects for performance reasons, you "
"may have to use pagination at some points."
msgstr ""
"Pošto Zammad ograničava broj vraćenih objekata iz performansi, možda ćete "
"morati da koristite paginaciju u određenim trenutcima."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:141
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Number of returned objects:** Zammad has hard limits for the\n"
"maximum returned objects. You can't raise these limits.\n"
"\n"
"**Number of total to return objects:** Zammad does not provide a total count of\n"
"objects available for your query, unless you explicitly request it. To include\n"
"the amount of search results, use the `with_total_count` or `only_total_count`\n"
"parameter.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Broj vraćenih objekata:** Zammad ima stroga ograničenja za maksimalan broj\n"
"vraćenih objekata. Ne možete povećati ova ograničenja.\n"
"\n"
"**Ukupan broj objekata za povratak:** Zammad ne pruža ukupan broj\n"
"objekata dostupnih za vaše upite, osim ako ih eksplicitno ne zatražite. Da biste uključili\n"
"broj rezultata pretrage, koristite parametar `with_total_count` ili `only_total_count`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to use pagination you'll need two get options: `per_page` and "
"`page`. Combine them to receive 5 results from the first result page: `?"
"page=1&per_page=5` - increase page count to get more results."
msgstr ""
"Da biste koristili paginaciju, potrebne su vam dve GET opcije: `per_page` i "
"`page`. Kombinujte ih da biste dobili 5 rezultata sa prve stranice: `?"
"page=1&per_page=5` - povećajte broj stranice da biste dobili više rezultata."

