#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/ticket.md:44
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**On behalf of users**\n"
"\n"
"If you want to create tickets on behalf of other users, use the\n"
"`customer_id` attribute. `ticket.agent` is mandatory for this. Use\n"
"`guess:{email address}` to save an API call if you don't know the\n"
"user's ID or want to create the user in question\n"
"(`\"customer_id\": \"guess:jane@doe.com\"`).\n"
"\n"
"**Add mention subscription right away**:\n"
"\n"
"Add the `mentions` attribute to your ticket payload and provide an\n"
"array of user ids to directly subscribe them during ticket creation.\n"
"\n"
"E.g.: `\"mentions\": [1, 5, 7, 8],`\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"**U ime korisnika**\n"
"\n"
"Ako želite da kreirate karte u ime drugih korisnika, koristite atribut\n"
"`customer_id`. Dozvola `ticket.agent` je obavezna za ovo. Koristite\n"
"`guess:{adresa e-pošte}` da biste uštedeli API poziv ako ne znate ID\n"
"korisnika ili želite da kreirate pomenutog korisnika\n"
"(`\"customer_id\": \"guess:jane@doe.com\"`).\n"
"\n"
"**Odmah dodajte pretplatu na pominjanja:**\n"
"\n"
"Dodajte atribut `mentions` u payload vaše karte i navedite\n"
"niz ID-jeva korisnika da biste ih direktno pretplatili tokom kreiranja karte.\n"
"\n"
"Npr.: `\"mentions\": [1, 5, 7, 8],`\n"
"\n"

