#. type: Title #
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:1
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:6
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Docker File Handling Examples"
msgstr "Primeri rukovanja datotekama u Dockeru"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:10
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you're not sure how to handle the backup files and how to create the "
"`restore` directory in the Docker volume, you can find some examples below."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste sigurni kako da obradite fajlove za backup i kako da kreirate "
"`restore` direktorijum u Docker volumenu, ispod možete naći nekoliko primera."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Restore Inside the Same Stack"
msgstr "Vraćanje unutar istog stack-a"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:14
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**Requires:** console access to the zammad-backup container.\n"
msgstr "**Zahteva:** pristup konzoli zammad-backup kontejnera.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you want to restore a backup from the same stack, you just have to create "
"the directory and copy/move the files into it. The following example starts "
"the **zammad-backup** container and copies _all_ .gz files from the backup "
"directory into the restore directory:"
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da vratite backup iz istog stack-a, potrebno je samo da kreirate "
"direktorijum i kopirate/pomesnite fajlove u njega. Sledeći primer pokreće "
"**zammad-backup** kontejner i kopira _sve_ .gz fajlove iz backup "
"direktorijuma u restore direktorijum:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:19
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose run --rm zammad-backup bash -c \"mkdir /var/tmp/zammad/restore; cp /var/tmp/zammad/*.gz /var/tmp/zammad/restore -v\"\n"
msgstr "docker compose run --rm zammad-backup bash -c \"mkdir /var/tmp/zammad/restore; cp /var/tmp/zammad/*.gz /var/tmp/zammad/restore -v\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:24
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:47
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now start the stack to execute the restore process."
msgstr "Sada pokrenite stack da izvrši proces vraćanja."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:25
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Restore from Another Installation"
msgstr "Инсталација у сопственој режији"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**Requires:** console access to the host system and the zammad-backup container.\n"
msgstr "**Zahteva:** pristup konzoli hostsistema i zammad-backup kontejnera.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:31
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To **obtain** your backup files from another Docker Compose deployment, one "
"way is to copy it to the host system with `docker compose cp`:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste **dobili** svoje backup fajlove iz druge Docker Compose deployement "
"instalacije, jedan način je da ih kopirate na hostsistem pomoću `docker "
"compose cp`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:32
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose cp zammad-backup:/var/tmp/zammad/ /path/to/your/host/directory/\n"
msgstr "docker compose cp zammad-backup:/var/tmp/zammad/ /path/to/your/host/directory/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In case you are searching for your backup files from a package installation, "
"have a look at the [Backup & Restore (Package)](/en/tutorials/backup-"
"restore) section. You don't need a full dump for restoring your backup."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da tražite svoje backup fajlove iz instalacije preko paketa, "
"pogledajte sekciju [Backup & Restore (Paket)](/en/tutorials/backup-restore). "
"Ne treba vam kompletna kopija za vraćanje backup-a."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To **restore** the backup, place your files in a folder called `restore` on "
"the host system. This folder is mounted temporarily to `/restore` in the "
"backup container. The directory then gets copied to the actual directory:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste **vratili** backup, postavite svoje fajlove u folder koji se zove "
"`restore` na hostsistemu. Ovaj folder je privremeno montiran na `/restore` u "
"backup kontejneru. Direktorijum se zatim kopira u pravi direktorijum:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:42
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose run --rm -v /path/to/your/host/directory:/restore zammad-backup bash -c \"cp -rv /restore /var/tmp/zammad/\"\n"
msgstr "docker compose run --rm -v /path/to/your/host/directory:/restore zammad-backup bash -c \"cp -rv /restore /var/tmp/zammad/\"\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:48
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Use a Web GUI"
msgstr "Korišćenje Web GUI-ja"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "**Requires:** console access to the host system or Portainer access with the permission to deploy a container.\n"
msgstr "**Zahteva:** pristup konzoli hostsistema ili Portainer pristup sa dozvolom za deployovanje kontejnera.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This can be useful if you use Portainer to deploy Zammad and have limited "
"access to the host system."
msgstr ""
"Ovo može biti korisno ako koristite Portainer za deployovanje Zammada i "
"imate ograničen pristup hostsistemu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our example uses the tool [filebrowser](https://filebrowser.org/)"
"{target=_blank}, but any similar tool should work too. If you'd like to use "
"such a tool permanently, make sure to provide additional volumes for "
"persistence (e.g. for their database)."
msgstr ""
"Naš primer koristi alat [filebrowser](https://filebrowser.org/), ali bi "
"trebao da radi i bilo koji sličan alat. Ako želite trajno da koristite takav "
"alat, obezbedite dodatne volume-e za perzistentnost (npr. za njihovu bazu "
"podataka)."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:58
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"The steps below cover the restore process by uploading files. To get your backup files in the same way from another\n"
"stack, you can follow steps 1-4 below and simply map the **zammad-backup** volume of your _old_ stack. Then you can\n"
"download the files, stop and remove the filebrowser container and redeploy it, following the steps below.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Koraci ispod pokrivaju proces vraćanja putem otpremanja fajlova. Da biste na isti način dobili svoje backup fajlove iz drugog\n"
"stack-a, možete pratiti korake 1-4 ispod i samo mapirati **zammad-backup** volume vašeg _starog_ stack-a. Zatim možete\n"
"downloadovati fajlove, zaustaviti i ukloniti filebrowser kontejner i ponovo ga deployovati, prateći korake ispod.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:67
#, fuzzy
msgid "Deploy filebrowser"
msgstr "Deployujte filebrowser"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:68
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"   === Via console\n"
"\n"
"   Deploy the container and provide the volume of **zammad-backup** and\n"
"   a port under which you want to access the web UI:\n"
"\n"
"   ``` sh\n"
"   docker run -v zammad-docker-compose_zammad-backup:/srv -p 8089:80 filebrowser/filebrowser\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"   === Via Portainer\n"
"\n"
"   In your Portainer web UI, go to **Containers** in the left menu and\n"
"   click the `Add container` button.\n"
"\n"
"   Add the following information:\n"
"\n"
"   - Name: enter a name which is not already in use.\n"
"   - Image: `filebrowser/filebrowser`\n"
"   - Map additional port: choose a port and map it to port `80` in the container.\n"
"   - Advanced container settings:\n"
"     - Switch to **Volumes** and click the `map additional volume` button.\n"
"     - Enter `/srv` in the container section and select the volume containing `zammad-backup`\n"
"   - Finally, click on **Deploy the container**.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   === Preko konzole\n"
"\n"
"   Deployujte kontejner i obezbedite volume od **zammad-backup** i\n"
"   port na kojem želite da pristupite web GUI-ju:\n"
"\n"
"   ``` sh\n"
"   docker run -v zammad-docker-compose_zammad-backup:/srv -p 8089:80 filebrowser/filebrowser\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"   === Preko Portainera\n"
"\n"
"   U vašem Portainer web GUI-ju, idite na **Containers** u levom meniju i\n"
"   kliknite na dugme `Add container`.\n"
"\n"
"   Dodajte sledeće informacije:\n"
"\n"
"   - Name: unesite ime koje već nije u upotrebi.\n"
"   - Image: `filebrowser/filebrowser`\n"
"   - Map additional port: izaberite port i mapirajte ga na port `80` u kontejneru.\n"
"   - Advanced container settings:\n"
"     - Prebacite se na **Volumes** i kliknite na dugme `map additional volume`.\n"
"     - Unesite `/srv` u sekciji kontejnera i izaberite volume koji sadrži `zammad-backup`\n"
"   - Na kraju, kliknite na **Deploy the container**.\n"
"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:102
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After the container is started, go to the web interface by using the IP "
"address and the port you defined."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je kontejner pokrenut, idite na web interfejs koristeći IP adresu "
"i port koji ste definisali."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:102
#, fuzzy
msgid "Log in with the default credentials `admin` / `admin`."
msgstr "Ulogujte se sa podrazumevanim kredencijalima `admin` / `admin`."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:102
#, fuzzy
msgid "You should now see at least 2 .gz files including a timestamp."
msgstr ""
"Sada bi trebalo da vidite najmanje 2 .gz fajla uključujući vremensku oznaku."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:102
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Create a `New folder` by using the button on the left side. Name it "
"**restore**."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte `Novi folder` koristeći dugme na levoj strani. Nazovite ga "
"**restore**."

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: src/en/tutorials/docker-file-handling.md:102
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enter this folder and upload your backup files (on the top right corner with "
"the up arrow). If the upload fails, it might be required to change the "
"permissions of the files (e.g. readable for everyone)."
msgstr ""
"Uđite u ovaj folder i otpremite svoje backup fajlove (u gornjem desnom uglu "
