#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:84 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:230
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:400 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:504
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Uvoz"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:89 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:235
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:509
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In general, you have two options on how to migrate data. If you have a "
"fairly big instance with a lot of data, you may want to consider using the "
"console over the browser version."
msgstr ""
"Opšte govoreći, imate dve opcije za migraciju podataka. Ako imate prilično "
"veliku instancu sa mnogo podataka, možda ćete razmotriti korišćenje konzole "
"umesto verzije u pretraživaču."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:90
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](./webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the number of users, tickets and Freshdesk plan this may take a\n"
"while.\n"
"\n"
"Seeing the message \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"If this message appears after providing your credentials, please be patient.\n"
"The migration should start within 5 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you receive above message after the migration begun, please consider using\n"
"the console approach instead and reset the installation.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables, replace the values in `{}` with your own:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad settings for freshdesk import:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Check your configuration in a dry run:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the migration:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Preko pretraživača\n"
"\n"
"Nakon instaliranja Zammada i [konfigurisanja vašeg web servera](./webserver-config), otvorite u pretraživaču domen (FQDN) vašeg Zammada i sledite čarobnjaka za migraciju. Možete ga pronaći na ekranu za prijavu klikom na vezu \"Ili migrirajte sa drugog sistema\" na dnu.\n"
"\n"
"Zavisno od broja korisnika, karata i Freshdesk paketa ovo može potrajati.\n"
"\n"
"Da li vidite poruku \"_Prekinuto restartovanjem zakazivača. Molimo vas da restartujete ručno ili sačekate sledeće vreme izvršavanja._\"?\n"
"Ako se ova poruka pojavi nakon unosanja vaših podataka za prijavu, molimo vas da budete strpljivi.\n"
"Migracija bi trebalo da počne u roku od 5 minuta.\n"
"\n"
"Ako dobijete gore navedenu poruku nakon što je migracija započela, razmotrite umesto toga korišćenje pristupa putem konzole i resetujte instalaciju.\n"
"\n"
"=== Preko konzole\n"
"\n"
"Otvorite konzolu:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Podesite promenljive, zamenite vrednosti u `{}` svojim:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ažurirajte Zammad podešavanja za freshdesk uvoz:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Proverite svoju konfiguraciju u testnom pokretanju:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Pokrenite migraciju:\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:90 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:510
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"Want to see the progress of the migration?\n"
"\n"
"Use\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"pp ImportJob.find_by(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"which gives you an output of the current state of the job.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Želite li da vidite progres migracije?\n"
"\n"
"Koristite\n"
"\n"
"```ruby\n"
"pp ImportJob.find_by(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"što će vam prikazati trenutno stanje posla.\n"
"\n"

